t resembles a tuft of grass and is thus easily overlooked in the field. Hybrids with A. trichomanes (A. xalternifolium Wulfen) are known (Wagner et al. 1993). Given its rareness and limited distribution in the state, we consider this species to be of conservation concern in TX." />
